# cppcheckparser.py
a tool to parse report from cppcheck, use git blame to find committer and produce final report

you might use `pip -r requirements.txt` to install dependent libraries.

cppcheck command: (v2.3)
cppcheck --enable=all --quiet --template='{file},{line},{severity},{id}:{message}' -I header_folder sourcecode_folder 2>output.txt
